From: MyszkinPL <211237936+MyszkinPL@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: tas571x: probe asynchronously

With the TAS5751M the probe sleeps for the supply sequencing, the
oscillator trim and the register script, about half a second per chip.
Built in, that held up the rest of the boot (the Yandex Station has two
of them); nothing depends on the amplifiers being there early.

Signed-off-by: MyszkinPL <211237936+MyszkinPL@users.noreply.github.com>
---
--- a/sound/soc/codecs/tas571x.c
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/tas571x.c
@@ -1445,6 +1445,8 @@
 	.driver = {
 		.name = "tas571x",
 		.of_match_table = of_match_ptr(tas571x_of_match),
+		/* supply sequencing and the oscillator trim sleep for ~0.5 s */
+		.probe_type = PROBE_PREFER_ASYNCHRONOUS,
 	},
 	.probe = tas571x_i2c_probe,
 	.remove = tas571x_i2c_remove,
